WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
EuroRollup shows how crypto trades and fund investments settle in euros.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Starting with a thousand demo euros, I buy two hundred euros of test ether. The receipt shows the five-cent charge.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:22.000
My fund order waits for its valuation. At ninety-six euros per unit, three hundred euros buys three and one eighth units.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Now I ask what happens if Friday's fund cutoff moves from four to three. The model turns my question into one proposed rule.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:44.000
I confirm the change and replay two orders. The earlier one still settles Friday. The three-thirty order now waits until Monday.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:55.000
That leaves three hundred extra euros reserved over the weekend. On Monday the later order receives three units. Both outcomes come with a reproducible record.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Open the project on GitHub and replay the experiment yourself.
